     1,
     "<div dir=\"auto\"><div style=\"font-family:calibri,arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\" dir=\"auto\">Dear Everyone,</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:calibri,arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\" dir=\"auto\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:calibri,arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\" dir=\"auto\">\r\nI&#39;m trying to write gl objects into a .csv files by using the function:</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:calibri,arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\" dir=\"auto\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:calibri,arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\" dir=\"auto\">\r\n<i style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">gl.write.csv(<a href=\"http://testset.gl\" style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://testset.gl&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459339800000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ZWE-rqBbeTnokWlXB2Ux0\">testset.gl</a>, outfile=&quot;SNP_1row.csv&quot;)</i></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:calibri,arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\" dir=\"auto\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:calibri,arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\" dir=\"auto\">\r\nI&#39;m getting the following error: </div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:calibri,arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\" dir=\"auto\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:calibri,arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\" dir=\"auto\">\r\n<div><span style=\"color:rgb(200,38,19);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">Error in data.frame(..., check.names = FALSE) :\r\n</span><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(200,38,19);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">  arguments imply differing number of rows: 0, 188</span><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:calibri,arial,helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\" dir=\"auto\">\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(200,38,19)\"><br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&#39;calibri&#39;,&#39;arial&#39;,&#39;helvetica&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\" dir=\"auto\"><font color=\"#c82613\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">Does anyone know how can I fix this error? I found the description of the function (below) just in case.</span></font></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&#39;calibri&#39;,&#39;arial&#39;,&#39;helvetica&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\" dir=\"auto\"><font color=\"#c82613\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">Thanks in advance for your help.</span></font></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&#39;calibri&#39;,&#39;arial&#39;,&#39;helvetica&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\" dir=\"auto\"><font color=\"#c82613\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">Monica</span></font></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&#39;calibri&#39;,&#39;arial&#39;,&#39;helvetica&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\" dir=\"auto\"><font color=\"#c82613\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br>\r\n</span></font></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&#39;calibri&#39;,&#39;arial&#39;,&#39;helvetica&#39;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt\" dir=\"auto\"><font color=\"#c82613\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<pre style=\"font-family:&#39;consolas&#39;,&#39;monaco&#39;,&#39;andale mono&#39;,monospace;font-size:12.6px;padding-left:1em;padding-right:1em;color:rgba(0,0,0,0.87)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(64,128,128);font-style:italic;font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">#&#39; Write out data from a gl object \\link{adegenet} to csv file</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(64,128,128);font-style:italic;font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">#&#39;</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(64,128,128);font-style:italic;font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">#&#39; This script writes to file the SNP genotypes with specimens as entities (columns) and</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(64,128,128);font-style:italic;font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">#&#39; loci as attributes (rows). Each row has associated locus metadata. Each column, with header</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(64,128,128);font-style:italic;font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">#&#39; of specimen id, has population in the first row. </span>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(64,128,128);font-style:italic;font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">#&#39; </span>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(64,128,128);font-style:italic;font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">#&#39; The data coding differs from the DArT 1 row format in that 0 = reference homozygous, 2 =</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(64,128,128);font-style:italic;font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">#&#39; alternate homozygous, 1 = heterozyous, and NA = missing SNP assignment. </span>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(64,128,128);font-style:italic;font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">#&#39;</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(64,128,128);font-style:italic;font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">#&#39; @param gl -- name of the genlight object containing SNP genotypes [required]</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(64,128,128);font-style:italic;font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">#&#39; @param outfile -- name of the csv file to write the data to [required]</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(64,128,128);font-style:italic;font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">#&#39; @param outpath -- path where to save the output file (set to tempdir by default)</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(64,128,128);font-style:italic;font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">#&#39; @return saves a glenlight object to csv</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(64,128,128);font-style:italic;font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">#&#39; @export</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(64,128,128);font-style:italic;font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">#&#39; @author Arthur Georges (bugs? Post to \\url{<a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/forum/dartr\" style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/forum/dartr&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459339800000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3WWhigxmF_kLF-e4gB4M4N\">https://groups.google.com/d/forum/dartr</a>})</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(64,128,128);font-style:italic;font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">#&#39; @examples</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(64,128,128);font-style:italic;font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">#&#39; gl.write.csv(<a href=\"http://testset.gl\" style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://testset.gl&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459339800000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ZWE-rqBbeTnokWlXB2Ux0\">testset.gl</a>, outfile=&quot;SNP_1row.csv&quot;)</span>\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://rdrr.io/cran/dartR/man/gl.write.csv.html\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:0px 0px;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;color:rgb(65,131,196);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/cran/dartR/man/gl.write.csv.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459339800000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Zypr9yj702Eu7YJ7VTCQK\">gl.write.csv</a> <span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,102);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255)\"><a href=\"https://rdrr.io/r/base/function.html\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:0px 0px;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;color:rgb(65,131,196);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/r/base/function.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459339800000&amp;usg=AOvVaw31I3FNU0aGrIajMVZdx3-1\">function</a></span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">(</span><a href=\"https://rdrr.io/r/base/gl.html\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:0px 0px;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;color:rgb(65,131,196);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/r/base/gl.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459339800000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3kk1_nPuToV0ctKvXH5k_Z\">gl</a><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">,</span> <span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">outfile</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,102);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(186,33,33);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">&quot;outfile.csv&quot;</span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">,</span> <span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">outpath</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,102);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255)\"><a href=\"https://rdrr.io/r/base/tempfile.html\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:0px 0px;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;color:rgb(65,131,196);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/r/base/tempfile.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459339800000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3ZhLShjk7c7DrkdU0dtwlx\">tempdir</a></span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">())</span> <span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">{</span>\r\n\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">outfile</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,102);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255)\"><a href=\"https://rdrr.io/r/base/file.path.html\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:0px 0px;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;color:rgb(65,131,196);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/r/base/file.path.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459339800000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3h5qpM_2QGMKpQ7xZl_tG7\">file.path</a></span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">(</span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">outpath</span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">,</span> <span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">outfile</span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">)</span>\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">x</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,102);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">&lt;-</span> <a href=\"https://rdrr.io/r/base/gl.html\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:0px 0px;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;color:rgb(65,131,196);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/r/base/gl.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459339800000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3kk1_nPuToV0ctKvXH5k_Z\">gl</a>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(64,128,128);font-style:italic;font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\"># Add individual names and population names to rows</span>\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">x1</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,102);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255)\"><a href=\"https://rdrr.io/r/base/cbind.html\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:0px 0px;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;color:rgb(65,131,196);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/r/base/cbind.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459339800000&amp;usg=AOvVaw03Rag1UYvUEwWS1o-FmYUM\">cbind.data.frame</a></span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">pop</span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">(</span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">x</span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">),</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255)\"><a href=\"https://rdrr.io/r/base/matrix.html\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:0px 0px;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;color:rgb(65,131,196);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/r/base/matrix.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459339800000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1wNs2MsIhAIm6aFwDVmGNf\">as.matrix</a></span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">(</span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">x</span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">))</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(64,128,128);font-style:italic;font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\"># Transpose to have id as columns, loci as rows  </span>\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">x1</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,102);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255)\"><a href=\"https://rdrr.io/r/base/t.html\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:0px 0px;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;color:rgb(65,131,196);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/r/base/t.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459339800000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0IXfaNsqBmdrvL-R723_bs\">t</a></span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">(</span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">x1</span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">)</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(64,128,128);font-style:italic;font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\"># Create two filler rows to bring number of data rows and number of locus.metadata rows together</span>\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">filler1</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,102);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255)\"><a href=\"https://rdrr.io/r/base/rep.html\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:0px 0px;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;color:rgb(65,131,196);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/r/base/rep.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459339800000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3JsUYgOE5QOrErpK_LjrYU\">rep</a></span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(186,33,33);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">&quot;*&quot;</span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255)\"><a href=\"https://rdrr.io/r/base/length.html\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:0px 0px;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;color:rgb(65,131,196);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/r/base/length.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459339800000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1le35M68KhefSSg9s3tIPQ\">length</a></span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">(</span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">x</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,102);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">@</span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">other</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,102);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">$</span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">loc.metrics[1</span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">,</span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">]</span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">))</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(64,128,128);font-style:italic;font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\"># Bind the filler rows to the locus metadata</span>\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">x2</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,102);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255)\"><a href=\"https://rdrr.io/r/base/cbind.html\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:0px 0px;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;color:rgb(65,131,196);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/r/base/cbind.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459339800000&amp;usg=AOvVaw03Rag1UYvUEwWS1o-FmYUM\">rbind</a></span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">(</span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">filler1</span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">,</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255)\"><a href=\"https://rdrr.io/r/base/matrix.html\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:0px 0px;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;color:rgb(65,131,196);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/r/base/matrix.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459339800000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1wNs2MsIhAIm6aFwDVmGNf\">as.matrix</a></span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">(</span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">x</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,102);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">@</span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">other</span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,102);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">$</span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">loc.metrics</span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">))</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(64,128,128);font-style:italic;font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\"># Bind the locus metadata to the data  </span>\r\n  <span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">x3</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(102,102,102);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255)\"><a href=\"https://rdrr.io/r/base/cbind.html\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:0px 0px;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;color:rgb(65,131,196);font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rdrr.io/r/base/cbind.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459339800000&amp;usg=AOvVaw03Rag1UYvUEwWS1o-FmYUM\">cbind.data.frame</a></span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">(</span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">x2</span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">,</span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">x1</span><span style=\"font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\">)</span>\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(64,128,128);font-style:italic;font-size:13.001pt;line-height:140%\"># Output   </span>\r\n  <span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255)\"><a href=\"https://rdrr.io/r/utils/write.table.html\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:0px 0px;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;color:rgb(65,131,196);font-size:13.001p